        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/b77776/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-31T14:52:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So. &nbsp;You've played through the Baron Blade scenarios a few times, and you think you know when to Teleport, when to Dodge, and when to Power Splice. &nbsp;But what if it isn't Baron Blade trying to take over the power grid, but Tachyon? &nbsp;Are her supersonic legs better at getting around the city than Baron's Teleporter? &nbsp;What about Ambuscade's Cloak?</p><p>Who is your favorite substitute villian in a scenario? &nbsp;Who would be broken, and who would make an interesting but balanced alternate? &nbsp;I think Proletariat could be ridiculous in BB Scenario 2, if he were to start deploying turrets 3 or 4 at a time using Overwhelm. &nbsp;Ambuscade might be broken in BB Scenario 1, with Cloaking and Feedback Plating.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:26.869Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
