        "raw": "<p>So. &nbsp;You&#39;ve played through the Baron Blade scenarios a few times, and you think you know when to Teleport, when to Dodge, and when to Power Splice. &nbsp;But what if it isn&#39;t Baron Blade trying to take over the power grid, but Tachyon? &nbsp;Are her supersonic legs better at getting around the city than Baron&#39;s Teleporter? &nbsp;What about Ambuscade&#39;s Cloak?</p><p>Who is your favorite substitute villian in a scenario? &nbsp;Who would be broken, and who would make an interesting but balanced alternate? &nbsp;I think Proletariat could be ridiculous in BB Scenario 2, if he were to start deploying turrets 3 or 4 at a time using Overwhelm. &nbsp;Ambuscade might be broken in BB Scenario 1, with Cloaking and Feedback Plating.</p>",
